5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the board minutes on a jointly run clinic to see what previous initiatives actually achieved.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records. I want to see if the physical and digital infrastructure can handle more volume.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the data agreements with outside surgeries and the visit completion on the shared nursing round. I am curious to see if our external partnerships are as sturdy as they appear on paper.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review! I want to make sure our wonderful teams aren't too tired to take on something new.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I shall look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. We must ensure our dreams are grounded in the reality of our finances.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
